editor_description = "TRUST level (Skeptic / Thoughtful / Blind trust, everything else average). Route: Start, A, B, C (south), E, Goal (all straight jumps). Each route platform has a closer dead end; the 'shortcut' east of B is 1 m too far. Minimums are placeholders."
